OL,3,GNEWSAEurovision winners put 'Fizz' into
OL,4,Arecycling push
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo founder members of Eurovision Song
OL,7,FContest winners Buck's Fizz are to mark
OL,8,Fa charity's 50th anniversary by helping
OL,9,Fto reveal the results of its campaign
OL,10,Fto convert CDs into cash for good
OL,11,Fcauses.
OL,13,FCheryl Baker and Jay Aston, now
OL,14,Fperforming with The Fizz, will be at
OL,15,FSelby Abbey in November as part of Up
OL,16,Ffor Yorkshire's celebrations.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
