OL,3,GNEWSAEurovision winners put 'Fizz' into
OL,4,Arecycling push
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe group will perform as Up for
OL,7,FYorkshire announces the sum raised by
OL,8,Fits Every Disc Makes a Difference
OL,9,Fcampaign, set up to raise charity cash
OL,10,Fand stop tonnes of unwanted CDs and
OL,11,FDVDs going to landfill.
OL,13,FProject manager Matt Fisher said: "This
OL,14,Fcampaign is a brilliant way for people
OL,15,Fto recycle unwanted discs and make a
OL,16,Freal impact right here in North
OL,17,FYorkshire."
